From 1f9a90987fa7dfdafdad9261c5b0543b35590d33 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tong <zhengtong0611@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 04:59:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/13] Mock server: side-bot channels

tools/mock_mate_server.py now serves /face/mate/next/{referee|for|against}
like the debate server (/face/mate/next is referee, unknown channels 404),
and a poll gets only its own channel's commands. The referee loop is
unchanged. Side-bot lines are text only, as the server sends BotLine and
BotTalk: say + talk on, then talk off after the line's hold time
(words / 2.5 + 3, clamped to 6-12 s).

- --bots: one line every 12 s, alternating for / against
- POST /say?channel=for&text=...[&hold=8]: one line now
- POST /stop?channel=for|all[&clear=1]: stop
---
 Assets/MATE ENGINE - Referee/README.md |  3 +
 tools/mock_mate_server.py              | 76 ++++++++++++++++++++++----
 2 files changed, 67 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Assets/MATE ENGINE - Referee/README.md b/Assets/MATE ENGINE - Referee/README.md
index df1f19e..93753c0 100644
